window.products.push({"id":257025,"name":"HISTORY COMPANY Il Ristorante Toscano “City of Crystal” Wine Glass 2-Piece Set, Crafted in the Tuscany Region of Italy (Gift Box Collection)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DJWnLvnDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Peculiarly Italian Mix of Dignity, Strength, and Charm. Unlike fashion, elegance goes beyond time.  The tradition of glassmaking in Tuscany dates back to the medieval period, most notably in Colle Val d’Elsa (the City of Crystal) for its extensive local woodlands which provide fuel for the kilns, and where native artisans have managed to keep ancient techniques and traditions intact. Engage your senses.  An intrinsic part of Italian wine culture, the definitive trattoria wine glass is shaped for the ultimate tasting experience and designed to elegantly decorate the table.  Beautiful cut lines ring an assertive crystal shape, lending an air of celebration to every occasion.  With Tuscan history and unmistakable style, these glasses are featured, not only on the tables of Italy’s finest restaurants, but in many Italian films, most recently during the formal dinner party scene on ‘My Brilliant Friend,’ the Italian HBO series set largely in and around Naples and based on the novels of Italian author Elena Ferrante. Offering a Gift Box Set of 2 Il Ristorante Toscano “City of Crystal” Wine Glasses, for keeping or giving.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DJWnLvnDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HISTORY COMPANY","source_asin":"B09Z767GG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z767GG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z767GG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
