window.products.push({"id":257134,"name":"Cocktail Mixing Glass - Bar Mixer Pitcher for Stirred Drink - Seamless and Handcrafted of Crystal Glass, 550ml / 18-ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yU1ZHtUOL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","description":"The mixing glass is enjoying a comeback in modern mixology, and this new handcrafted, handblown, mixing glass is at the forefront of that comeback. As bartending supplies enjoy revival back from quickfix, just-get-you-drunk cocktail era - we're makin the best tools for you bar set. Dilution of drinks like a Manhattan or Old Fashioned is the surest way to decrease the quality of your drink. That's why, in a spirit or liquor forward drink, stirring a cocktail is the best way to preserve the flavor of that delicious bourbon or whiskey your showcasing and measured out perfectly in your jigger. Leave the cocktail shaker set to those who like their drinks watered down. A viciously fast stir is best to chill cocktails without dilution. And for that fast stir, a heavy mixing glass allowing leverage is key. Our sturdy bar accessories mixer pitcher helps you do just that. We recommend our 18” long bar spoon for most efficient and effective stirs. The thick, workhorse of the industry. cocktailery tools aren't all created equal. Your bar accessories effect your drinks - so choose wisely - We promise a quality product and if you're not happy well replace or refund you. Stir away friends. Cheers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yU1ZHtUOL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mixologists","source_asin":"B082GQRVD5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082GQRVD5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082GQRVD5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
