window.products.push({"id":257166,"name":"LIEUYANX 60 Pcs Natural Dried Pampas Grass - 15 Pcs White Pampas & 15 Pcs Brown Pampas & 30 Pcs Reed Grass Boho Decor for Living Room Home Wedding Par","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hgQOFjd+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Warm Tips】Please place your pampas under the sun for 3-5 hours, so that the pampas can breathe in the fresh air and become fluffy once again.There may be a little shedding as it is a natural pampas grass plant, it's a normal phenomenon. Shedding will not change the final appearance of the bouquet. 【Perfect Size】The natural dry pampas grass grows about 16.5\"-17\". You can cut it to fit the length of your vase to perfectly decorate your room, it creates a natural atmosphere and make your room look warmer and more refined. 【Natural materials】Selected high-quality natural pampas grass, giving you the original touch, non-toxic and harmless.We have retained the original color of the dried pampas grass, and the feathers are full and even. It does not require daily care and pruning, and is suitable for decoration in all seasons. Here you will feel the charm of nature. 【Includes】All in 60 Pcs pampas grass decors, including 30 Pcs reed grass, 15 Pcs white pampas, and 15 Pcs brown pampas. It has a perfect sense of continuous layering from dark to light. 【Widely Used】The pompass grass branches natural has rich soft plume that will blend any decoration house, office, party, garden, hotel, cafes, balcony, wedding etc. At the same time, you can also use it as a suitable gift for birthdays, wedding anniversaries, Halloween, Thanksgiving, Christmas and other important holidays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hgQOFjd+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIEUYANX","source_asin":"B09GKKJ299","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GKKJ299","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GKKJ299","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":257167,"name":"Boston International Ideal Home Range 20-Count 3-Ply Paper Lunch Napkins, Linen Tea Rose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719WnshL4+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Create dynamic tablescapes and stunning place settings by pairing patterned napkins with matching plates and coordinating solids. Plates and napkins are offered in multiple sizes, allowing you to mix and match, layer and customize. Ideal Home Range offers a sustainable option for conscientious consumers, producing 100% biodegradable napkins using the safest tissues, inks and printing processes. IHR napkin tissue is 100% cellulose from cracked wood (fallen trees) and plantation wood (managed forests where trees are planted specifically for the production of paper materials) and all tissue is oxygen bleached without the use of chlorine. IHR ink is water soluble, contains no heavy metals or solvents of any kind and meets the requirements of German Food and Health laws and the USFDA. Used ink is never dumped into sewage and is always recycled and reintegrated into the color system. The production working area is naturally pollution-free and no harmful emissions are produced. IHR has earned a certificate of approval from the Forest Stewardship Council (FSC), a prestigious certificate only awarded to those who meet all of the FSC's standards for sustainability, forest management, well being of the forest workers and effects on indigenous peoples and the local environment. Ideal Home Range is exclusively represented in the United States by Boston International and is considered to be the international market leader and trendsetter in the field of high-class table decoration and interior accessories. IHR began in an old village school in Germany in 1977, when Ingrid and Hanjo Rick conceived the idea of producing accessories in the arts and crafts tradition in order to communicate their concept of interior design. They soon discovered the tissue napkin as a design object and the basis of stylish table decorations and turned it into the key feature of their product. More than 8,000 items are offered today in most countries of the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719WnshL4+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ideal Home Range","source_asin":"B00J0VHY1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J0VHY1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J0VHY1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
