window.products.push({"id":257239,"name":"Vyfipt Twin XL Size Memory Foam Mattress 10 Inch Bed in a Box Bamboo Charcoal Infused Gel Foam Cooling Medium Firm Mattress - Breathable - No Box Spri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T0f5A9+CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MADE IN USA】This mattress is manufactured in South Carolina and Arizona Factory with unparalleled quality control you can trust. Mattresses designed by Vyfipt undergo 115 quality tests which contain 80,000 cycles of Foam Performance Testing and 100,000 cycles of Mattress Durability Testing. Passed the Oeko-Tex Standard 100 and CertiPur-US certification. 【Cooling Feel】The bamboo charcoal gel memory foam has an open cell structure that allows air to flow through the mattress so that the temperature of the mattress can be effectively controlled. Moreover, the middle layer that is infused with cooling gel can also keep your temp regulated! Even on a very hot and humid night, you can still enjoy a cool and comfortable night's sleep. It is perfect for HOT Sleepers. 【Medium Feel】Not too firm nor too plush. Lying on this mattress, you will feel very relaxed. The top two layers of the mattress can precisely fit your body, supporting your shoulders, waist and legs so that the pressure of your body is evenly distributed on the mattress. The bottom Flex Support Base Foam is strongly supportive. It can fully support your body. It is easy to move around on. 【Fiberglass-free and Removable Cover】The removable jacquard cover is 100% fiberglass-FREE. You can truly rest at ease at night without worrying about negative aspects of fiberglass and other fire-retardant chemicals. No skin irritation. No breathing problems. No health risks. The outer cover is removable so you can clean it easily. 【Fiberglass-free and Removable Cover】The removable jacquard cover is 100% fiberglass-FREE. You can truly rest at ease at night without worrying about negative aspects of fiberglass and other fire-retardant chemicals. No skin irritation. No breathing problems. No health risks. The outer cover is removable so you can clean it easily. 【NONTEMPERATURE SENSITIVE TECHNOLOGY】As we all know, ordinary memory foam is hot in the summer and hard in texture in the winter and poor comfortability. Vyfipt non-temperature sensitive memory foam which is not affected by ambient temperature provides the most average and true support, makes the part contacted in length time of the body to be at the state of no pressure, not hinders the blood circulation and not easily produces fatigue and soreness. 【10 Year Warranty】Vyfipt mattresses are backed with a 10-year warranty. We are committed to providing the best service for every customer. If you have any problem, please contact us promptly and we are always at your service. Vyfipt memory foam mattress is compressed, rolled, and shipped in a box. For a better sleeping experience, please allow 24 hours at least for the mattress to fully expand. 【Supreme Support Performance】The bottom Flex Support Base Foam is strongly supportive. The maximum weight capacity is 800lbs except twin size (Twin mattress supports up to 350 lbs). 【70-Day Money-Back Guarantee】Besides a 10-year warranty, we provide a 70-day long free trial policy. If you feel it is not suitable for you, you can contact us for a refund. Generally, there will be a few days of adaptation period for the first use. After that, you will enjoy this amazing mattress.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T0f5A9+CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vyfipt","source_asin":"B0B73M99V9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B73M99V9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B73M99V9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
