window.products.push({"id":257330,"name":"DeluxeComfort Better Sleep Microbead Bed-Pillows","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jH-VmIu0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Softer Sleep and More Snuggly Satisfaction! You've been tossing and turning every night for some time now. No matter how you position yourself, you just can't seem to get comfortable. You wake up each morning with a sore neck and an aching back, and no matter how long you sleep you just don't feel rested anymore. It's definitely time for a new pillow, but how to choose among all the available kinds? What you need is the Cloud Pillow with Arm Hole, by Deluxe Comfort. This uniquely-designed pillow features two arm holes, or actually more like arm tunnels, that help you be in the perfect position no matter how you lay. One arm tunnel runs horizontally across the front of the pillow, and the other cuts right through the middle of the pillow, giving you the option of several comfortable positions. And because freeing your arm up improves its circulation, you won't wake up with \"dead hand\" in the morning anymore, or have to experience the pins and needles as your arm wakes up. The ergonomic construction of this cloud pillow holds your head and neck in the best position for support, helping to both prevent and alleviate sore or stiff neck and back muscles. It is most suitable for side sleepers, but also works well for stomach sleepers. Even those who sleep on their back will experience a sweeter slumber. And it's just the right size and shape to let you snuggle in closer to a loved one. The air-filled micro beads mold to the contours of your head and neck, making this the softest \"cloud\" you'll ever sleep on. GET YOURS NOW before this amazing pillow sells out and experience SOFTER SLEEPING!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jH-VmIu0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deluxe Comfort","source_asin":"B00D45ZRZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D45ZRZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D45ZRZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":257331,"name":"Professional Honing Steel (10” or 12”), Magnetized for Safety, No Rust, No Cheap Plastic! Noble’s Knife Sharpener Has an Oval Handle for a Firm Grip a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iK0yZTflL._AC_SL1040_.jpg","description":"MAGNETIZED FOR SAFETY: While honing steels (sometimes referred to as sharpening steels) realign your knife’s edge for a sharper cut, they can also cause tiny metal particles from your blade to become airborne. Our honing rods are magnetized to prevent those particles from being inhaled or landing on nearby food. BUILT TO LAST THROUGH YEARS OF USE: Noble Home & Chef’s honing steels are made of high quality, hardened carbon steel. Every material in our knife hone was meticulously chosen. You won’t find cheap plastic handles or soft, inexpensive steel. When you hold it, the weight immediately reveals how solid the construction is, and the design adds class to any kitchen. NO RUSTING: Once hardened, our honing steels go through our proprietary chromium plating process, which prevents rust and corrosion. RETAINS MORE METAL ON YOUR KNIFE EDGE: Knife steels are designed to be used often, but without taking off too much of your knife’s edge metal. This is contrary to diamond knife sharpeners or wet stone sharpeners, which should be used sparingly. (More details in product description.) DISHWASHER SAFE: While it is not necessary to wash honing steels after each use, it is recommended you wipe the stropping steel down with a wet cloth to remove the metal particles. For deeper cleaning, our honing rod is dishwasher safe!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51iK0yZTflL._AC_SL1040_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Noble Home & Chef","source_asin":"B076NY267G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076NY267G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076NY267G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
