window.products.push({"id":257465,"name":"Skinny Silicone Jar/Icing Spatula Set - Set of 3 - Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iaHzunFVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Skinny Silicone Spatula Set is the utensil you didn't know you needed. Also called a butter knife spatula, it's the perfect shape for icing cakes, spreading brownies, or scraping the last mayonnaise out of the jar. The slim and flexible silicone heads reach into small mouthed jars with ease. This spatula is flexible to reach into tight corners, not stiff. Safe for your nonstick cookware, they won't retain odors, lose their shape or stain. The blade is heat safe up to 350 degrees. Tie a festive ribbon around these 3 bright spatulas, or through the holes in the handles and it's an easy hostess gift or present topper. Perfect for the upcoming wedding season or Christmas stocking stuffers. Satisfaction guaranteed! If at any time you aren't completely satisfied, contact Specialty Home for a replacement. Set of 3 red spatulas. Each spatula measures 10.5\" long x 1\" wide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iaHzunFVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Specialty Kitchen","source_asin":"B00XQ0YHLE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XQ0YHLE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XQ0YHLE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
