window.products.push({"id":257477,"name":"Kitchen Electric Pro 5 Tier Food Dehydrator, Snackmaster, Food Preserver, (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-kRZqc7oL._AC_SL1077_.jpg","description":"Food Dehydration Dehydrate your food for enhanced preservation. Remove the moisture content from your food to make healthy snacks while retaining 97 percent of vitamins and minerals. To dehydrate, the unit reaches a maximum temperature of 180°F. The enhanced air flow ensures that the high-heat circulation travels through each tray and dehydrates evenly. Food Preserver (Perfect for Food Storage) The Food Dehydrator is perfect for food storage. It causes the food to shrink, therefore, making it easier to put away. The dehydrator has been tested and scientifically proven to increase the foods’ shelf life. This method is healthier than canning or freezing. Stackable 5-Tier Trays The 5 included tier trays allow increased air-flow around your food for a more even and rapid dehydration. Once your food is dehydrated, you can later reconstitute dried foods. (Food Reconstitution: when dried food absorbs water & swells to original size). The simple one-press button operation makes this unit incredibly easy to use. How do use Simply insert your food into the trays and hit the switch to activate a new and healthier level of food preparation. The Dehydrator effectively works to remove moisture, drying your food and reducing spoilage. The multi-level trays allow for enhanced air-flow that dehydrates food for prolonged shelf-life & preservation. Your food will last longer and the removal of moisture content is far more beneficial than canning or freezing. Dehydration retains up to 97% of the food's nutritional value and is scientifically tested to reduce spoilage times -- and best of all, it will still tastes great! Once dried, your food will retain original vitamins, minerals and flavor! The simple one-touch button operation makes it even easier to prepare foods like meat, fish, poultry, fruits, vegetables and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-kRZqc7oL._AC_SL1077_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"La Mieux","source_asin":"B01N3RQGEJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N3RQGEJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N3RQGEJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
