window.products.push({"id":257508,"name":"GOURLAB+ Microwave Cookware 6 in 1 Anyday Cookware Freezer & Oven Safe, Vegetable, Rice, Ramen Microwave Steamer BPA Free (Black) - Made in Japan…","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X8y3amNCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Suitable for OVEN cooking】:The body can be used in the oven (below 230 degrees). Bread and muffins can be easily baked and the fun of cooking spreads. The main body of GOURLAB is made of a special resin called \"syndiotactic polystyrene\". It is strong against impact and durable, and the heat-resistant temperature is 230. It does not deform even with the oil content of meat and fish, making it possible to cook chicken steaks, spare ribs, and other dishes that use a lot of oil. 【JAPANESE QUALITY MICROWAVE STEAMER】 : In one container, you can perform multiple steps because have PATENTED HEATING STRUCTURE.This Japan kitchen gadget has a structure that controls the steam similar to a pressure cooker,when the food is cooked in a microwave steamer for cooking. You can also cook in the oven by removing the lid. 【HEALTHY COOKWARE】 : It supports heIalthy cooking.Use GOURLAB and easily change the dishes you eat and your diet.Equipped with an Oil filter,you can remove excess oil from various dishes.Of course, it is also ideal for vegetable steamer. 【6 COOKING STYLES in 1 CONTAINER】:EASY & QUICK!! You can also cook 6-in-1 using this microwave cooker, baking, boiling, stir-fry, steaming, rice cooker. You can cook as if you were using fire.And this Japan product is as a Japanese gift too. Ramen, Pasta, Vegetables, Chicken, Beef, and More. Heatproof temperature: 450℉/Body 320℉/Cover, Cold resistant temperature: -40℉/Body & Cover, Can also be used in the oven(other than the lid), and be stored frozen.So suitable for food storage container.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81X8y3amNCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOURLAB+","source_asin":"B09YYW2CPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YYW2CPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YYW2CPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
