window.products.push({"id":257587,"name":"BUTTERFLYERS! White Exploding Butterfly Box with Monarch Flying Butterflies (Multi Cobalt Color Monarch Flying Butterfly x 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pd0OHwtXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The exploding butterfly box is a fabulous way to make a memory that will last a lifetime! In fact, thanks to all the amazing memories people make using our famous flying butterflyers (4 Flying Butterflies Included But Not Prewound) and butterfly explosion gift box, they think they're priceless and you will too! This is the perfect gift for Christmas, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Birthdays, Anniversaries, Thank You gifts and more! Imagine the shock, surprise and laughter when someone opens up the Butterflyers' Exploding Butterfly Gift Box and multiple wind up flying butterflies come flying out at the same time! Butterflyers custom made this gift box to perfectly fit up to 12 of our famous wind up flying butterflies inside the box (4 Butterflies Included - Choose Color/Style Above). There are many different colors/designs of our famous flying butterfly to choose from (see options above) to put inside your explosion gift box (Butterflyers Are Not Prewound- You Must Wind Them). With 12 different panels that all fall down when the top is removed, you have up to 24 different panels to add your own photos, bling, glitter, stickers, confetti, text or anything else you can imagine. You can really make it to be just about anything you want! Once you have finished decorating your flying butterfly gift box, just wind the butterflies up and place them carefully inside the panels of the exploding butterfly box (see instructional video). Then, get ready for lots of laughs, smiles and memorable moments with someone you love. The only limit to this exploding butterfly gift box is your own creativity and imagination. This is for the boxes only. Not the greeting cards","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Pd0OHwtXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUTTERFLYERS!","source_asin":"B09R2KK721","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R2KK721","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R2KK721","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
