window.products.push({"id":257605,"name":"SMETA Wine Beverage Refrigerator Cooler - 19 Inch Beverage Wine Cooler Cellar with Stainless Steel Frame Glass Front Door - 3.6 Cu.Ft|33 Bottles Wine ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jT5Q3mAPS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Wine Beverage fridge is an appliance in which you store wine to keep wine cold and chill your wine to a certain temperature. Wine collectors love to keep their wine cool and refreshing without having to take up space in their refrigerator such as white wines, wine cooler beverages. A carbonated beverage such as carbonated water or soda gives the drink a fizz. This drink is better served chilled, and ice can be added to the drink in summer. Wine fridge refrigerator comes equipped with 5 internal adjustable shelving designed to hold your wine at the correct angle, while also implementing some design techniques to ensure your wine remains stable and perfect.You can freely adjust the internal height and can accommodate about 33 bottles of wines or 80-120 canned beverage drinks and combine wine & drinks as you like depending on the placement and beverage size. Wine refrigerator coolers are designed to stay at a certain temperature, the temperature ranging from 39.2℉~64.4℉ (4~18 °C) in order to keep the wine from going bad and helping to preserve the flavor. The digital temperature control will allow you to adjust and bring out your wine's aromas. Keep in mind that all wine—red, white, sparkling and fortified—ages properly at the 53 to 57 temperature range Dimensions: 18.9 W x 18.7 Dx 33.5H inches. SMETA Wine coolers are also designed to limit the amount of vibration from the condenser motor so that the wine is not jostled around or stirred up in any way, which could disturb the wine’s natural aging process. Wine coolers are also designed to minimize the amount of natural light that makes it to the bottles stored inside. Light can damage the flavor of the wine, so ensuring that minimal natural light makes its way into the cooler is essential in keeping the wine preserved. Please allow at least 2 inches of space on both sides and 4 inches on the back and top for proper air circulation and cooling performance. Each cooler is backed by the 1-year warranty, and we provide US-based customer support and technical assistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jT5Q3mAPS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMETA","source_asin":"B09793QQ7H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09793QQ7H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09793QQ7H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
