window.products.push({"id":257732,"name":"Kore Small Sculpture Statue of Persephone Ancient Greek Queen of The Underworld Artifact","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+jd0wkfPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In Greek mythology, Persephone, also called Kore ( \"the maiden\") or Cora, is the daughter of Zeus and the harvest goddess Demeter, and is the queen of the underworld. Homer describes her as the formidable, venerable majestic princess of the underworld, who carries into effect the curses of men upon the souls of the dead. Persephone was married to Hades, the god-king of the underworld. The myth of her abduction represents her function as the personification of vegetation, which shoots forth in spring and withdraws into the earth after harvest; hence, she is also associated with spring as well as the fertility of vegetation. (B230) Details: Condition: New, reproduction handmade in Greece. Approximately Height: 16cm - 6.3 inches Width: 4cm - 1.5 inches Weight: 180g Material: Casting stone","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+jd0wkfPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Talos Artifacts","source_asin":"B07SSVQ58H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257732","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SSVQ58H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SSVQ58H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
