window.products.push({"id":257780,"name":"Freshware Silicone Non-Stick Baking Mat, Quarter Size, 11.6 x 8.1 inch,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O3mpqLlML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Freshware BM-101 Silicone Non-Stick Baking Mat with Cut Corner for Macaron, Whoopie Pie, Cookie, Creme Puff and more, Quarter Size, 11.6 x 8.1 inch turns any pan or rack into a non-stick surface instantly. It fits perfectly into a 13 x 9.5 inch quarter size sheet pan. (Mat Size: 295 x 205 mm for a 330 x 240 mm quarter size sheet pan) Our baking mat is made with 100% pure, premium quality food-grade silicone, which meets US FDA and European LFGB safety standards (BPA, PVC and Phthalate FREE). Used daily by professionals, it offers multi-purpose uses for preparing, roasting, baking, freezing and heating up food. Great for working with sticky materials such as fresh dough, macaroon, cookie, candies, taffy, caramel, cheese, meat, vegetables, baked or frozen goods. Eliminate the messy task and added calories of prepping with cooking sprays, oils or butter. Baked goods slide off with ease and bottoms won't burn. Nothing will stick to it. The fiber-glass weave creates even heat distribution so all your favorite recipes come out perfect every time. Custom cut corners provides easy removal from the pan. Cleaning up is a breeze, simply wipe with a damp, soft sponge with soap, rinse with clean water, shake to remove excess water, and dry in open air. Lay flat or roll to store. All Freshware silicone products DO NOT have Chemical Coatings. Our silicone baking mat handles temperature from -40 to +500 degrees Fahrenheit (-40 to +260 degrees Celsius). Reusable for up to 5,000 uses, save money by eliminating the need to ever buy parchment paper again. Safe to use in the Oven, Refrigerator, Freezer, Microwave and Dishwasher. Top rack dishwasher safe, but hand washing is recommended to extend the life of the product. Silicone baking mat is not to be used as a cutting surface. Sharp objects will damage the mat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O3mpqLlML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freshware","source_asin":"B00OSYC8XG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OSYC8XG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OSYC8XG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":257781,"name":"Jeyew Christmas Stocking Holder Stand with 30 Lights, Metal Stocking Stand for Floor, Merry Christmas Stocking Hanger Rack, Sparkling Christmas Decora","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TgjCyMVvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🎄 THE BEST CHRISTMAS DECOR - \"Merry Christmas\" on the stand are inlaid with sequins and shine in the sunlight. The artificial white vines, decorated with berries, poinsettia flowers, and natural pine cones, are attached with 30 battery-operated lights. Dazzling and attractive day and night, this Christmas stocking holder stand is the best Christmas decoration, whether you put it by the fireplace or the Christmas tree. ✔️ QUALITY METAL, WIDE APPLICATIONS - These stands are made of high-quality iron material, which is solid and durable for prolonged use. The stand body is fixed with wing bolts, and the 2 stand legs are designed with large 11.2-inch supports for a sturdy and stable structure that can withstand enough weight. In addition to hanging your Christmas stockings, it can also be used to hang garlands, colored lights, clothes, bags, etc. It is a good display and storage helper for your home! ✨ TWO LIGHT MODES TO CHOOSE FROM - 3 AA batteries (not included) are required to light up, and there are 2 modes of constant light as well as flashing light to choose from, depending on your preference. The stand is equipped with a particular battery box slot; the light bulbs are very convenient to switch on and off, and keep the Christmas stocking holder stand always beautiful. 🎅 COMES WITH 10 HOOKS - For your whole family's Christmas stocking display use and backup needs. Hang up your favorite stocking and wait for Santa Claus with your family during the busiest and most wonderful time of the year. 📦 DIMENSIONS & INSTALLATION - The stand measures 35.5 \"L x 11.2 \"W x 38.5 \"H, and the package box measures 14.5 \"L x 11.5 \"W x 2 \"H. It takes only 10 minutes to install (instruction is included in the package), or it can be easily disassembled and received in the package box, making it very easy to store and will not take up space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TgjCyMVvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jeyew","source_asin":"B0BBT7Y2X8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBT7Y2X8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBT7Y2X8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
