window.products.push({"id":257908,"name":"7 Inch Springform Pan Non-stick Leakproof 2 Removable Bottom, Egg Rack, Brush Pressure Cooker Accessories Set Fit for Instant Pot 5 6 8 qt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GFumISIQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【ALL KINDS OF FOOD】: 7 * 2.65 inch Springformt cake pan, Professional bundt pan for baking classic tube cakes, festive bread and other delicious food.Make the Perfect Cheesecake, Bundt cake, Lasagna, Meatloaf, Taco Pie, and More! 【DURABLE and SAFE】: Springformt cake pan made with nonstick carbon steel, strong, durable, black nonstick coating and food grade most IDEAL for baking cheesecakes. Oven safe to 445℉ (230℃). Perfect fit for 5, 6 and 8 Qt Pressure cookers and Instant Pot. Also used in a variety of Air Fryers. 【NON STICK & EASY CLEAN】: Double layer non-stick coating allows easy separation from cake mold and eliminates the need for flouring the cheesecake pan. But ,the batter don't adjust too loose! If the batter is too thin, it will leak. Avoid sharp and rough tools to scratch the birthday cake pan. 【MULTI-PURPOSE INSTANT POT STEAMER TRIVET】: Fit for 6Qt or 8Qt Instant Pot and pressure cooker. Such as Power Pressure Cooker XL, Instant Pot IP-LUX60, IP-DUO60, IP-DUO80, IP-LUX80. If you want to make cheesecakes and desserts with pressure cooker, you must add it to your accessories. Because the trivet compatible with instant pot with long handles works great for lifting out springform pan and steamer pot, or any dishes. Will also be perfect for cooking fish, chicken, meats & veggies etc. 【HEAT RESISTANT HANDLES】: Fish&Fairy pressure cooker trivet with 5.2 inch heat resistant handles which makes this trivet for pressure cooker easier and safer to take food from your pot without burning yourself. It easier to remove meat and veggies from the liquid without having to wait until it cools way down. 1 inch trivet compatible with instant pot above water when steaming, keep food out of the liquid, never worried about water overflow on top of the food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GFumISIQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fish&Fairy","source_asin":"B07MN2Y7HH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-257908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MN2Y7HH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MN2Y7HH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
